# ============================================================================
# UAgent/OpenHands - Secure API Key Configuration Template
# ============================================================================
#
# This file is a template for storing sensitive API keys and credentials.
# Copy this file to .env.local and add your actual API keys.
#
# IMPORTANT:
# - .env.local is gitignored and will NOT be committed to version control
# - Never commit actual API keys to the repository
# - Keep your .env.local file secure and private
#
# ============================================================================

# DashScope API Configuration (Required for Research Mode)
# ============================================================================
# DashScope is Alibaba Cloud's AI service platform
# Get your API key from: https://dashscope.console.aliyun.com/apiKey
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=sk-your-actual-dashscope-api-key-here
DASHSCOPE_BASE_URL=https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1

# Alternative LLM Providers (Optional)
# ============================================================================
# If you want to use OpenAI instead of DashScope:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-openai-api-key-here
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1

# If you want to use Anthropic Claude:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-anthropic-api-key-here

# If you want to use local LLM:
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434

# GitHub API Token (Optional - for repository operations)
# ============================================================================
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_your_github_personal_access_token_here

# Other Service Credentials (Optional)
# ============================================================================
# Add any other API keys or sensitive configuration here
# They will be automatically loaded when the backend starts

# ============================================================================
# Usage Instructions:
# ============================================================================
# 1. Copy this file:
#    cp .env.local.template .env.local
#
# 2. Edit .env.local and replace placeholder values with your actual API keys:
#    nano .env.local  # or use your preferred editor
#
# 3. Verify your configuration (should show first 10 chars of your key):
#    source .env.local && echo $DASHSCOPE_API_KEY | head -c 10
#
# 4. Start the backend:
#    ./start_openhands_research.sh
#
# 5. Check backend logs to confirm LLM classification is working:
#    tmux attach -t uagent-backend
#    # Look for: "TaskClassifier initialized with OpenHands LLM config"
#    # Instead of: "No API key found for TaskClassifier"
#
# ============================================================================